<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.9">
<l>paṉikkaṭalil paḷḷikōḷaip paḻakaviṭ ṭōṭivanteṉ</l>
<l>maṉakkaṭalil vāḻavalla māyama ṇāḷanampī</l>
<l>taṉikkaṭalē taṉiccuṭarē taṉiyula kēyeṉṟeṉṟu</l>
<l>uṉakkiṭamā yirukkaveṉṉai yuṉakkurit tākkiṉaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Having abandoned [your] practice of sleeping in the cool sea,</l>
<l>[my] wonderous bridegroom, [my] Prince, able to come running</l>
<l rend="indent">to live in the sea of my heart,</l>
<l>while saying that the matchless sea,</l>
<l rend="indent">the matchless sun, the matchless world</l>
<l>are your homes, you stripped me [bare and] made me yours.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
